---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Remove a template

Usage: sbt template rm [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Template name or ID (prefix)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -f, --force
          Skip confirmation prompts

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: table, json or yaml

          [possible values: table, json, yaml]

      --json
          Output in JSON format

  -h, --help
          Print help
